{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01791",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.88,
      "end_seconds": 3.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Hello, come in. Mind the step."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.44,
      "end_seconds": 7.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Hello, thanks for fitting me in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.26,
      "end_seconds": 10.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Start wherever you like, I'm listening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.86,
      "end_seconds": 19.31,
      "duration_seconds": 7.45,
      "text": "Doctor, it's a sore on my ankle that won't heal. It's getting on my nerves now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.3,
      "end_seconds": 24.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "How many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.41,
      "end_seconds": 37.34,
      "duration_seconds": 10.93,
      "text": "Honestly I can't say exactly when it started. It might have been last month or the month before, I really can't pin it down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.56,
      "end_seconds": 41.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Right, what eases it, if anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.19,
      "end_seconds": 46.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Okay, so elevation helps a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.05,
      "end_seconds": 50.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "Okay, how strong would you say it is?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.24,
      "end_seconds": 63.01,
      "duration_seconds": 8.77,
      "text": "Mild, really. And aching legs, too. There was swollen legs by evening, yes, but that went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.0,
      "end_seconds": 66.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.96,
      "end_seconds": 70.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "Amoxicillin. I come out in... well, hives."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.6,
      "end_seconds": 76.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.72,
      "end_seconds": 90.18,
      "duration_seconds": 12.46,
      "text": "My partner and our baby. I retired from the post office two years ago. Not much, I mostly stay in these days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.32,
      "end_seconds": 96.35,
      "duration_seconds": 5.03,
      "text": "Can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.37,
      "end_seconds": 110.73,
      "duration_seconds": 12.36,
      "text": "I'm on thyroxine, 75 micrograms, every morning for my thyroid. I'm on hydrochlorothiazide, 12.5 milligrams, every morning for my pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.23,
      "end_seconds": 115.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "How long have you taken that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.55,
      "end_seconds": 117.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "About nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.63,
      "end_seconds": 133.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Okay, what about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.15,
      "end_seconds": 145.91,
      "duration_seconds": 11.76,
      "text": "I have an underactive thyroid. I did try to ignore it for a while. I've had high blood pressure for five years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.01,
      "end_seconds": 158.05,
      "duration_seconds": 11.04,
      "text": "Yes, high blood pressure is known to us, good to have that clear. And what about chest pain, fever or calf pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.64,
      "end_seconds": 161.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "No, none that I've noticed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.99,
      "end_seconds": 167.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "How about spreading redness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.01,
      "end_seconds": 171.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "No spreading redness, thankfully."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.78,
      "end_seconds": 174.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Any trouble with the waterworks?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.0,
      "end_seconds": 177.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.53,
      "text": "Nothing there, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.5,
      "end_seconds": 182.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "How are your bowels, any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.21,
      "end_seconds": 185.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "Nothing unusual, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.43,
      "end_seconds": 190.81,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "Can I check a few measurements before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.36,
      "end_seconds": 205.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.76,
      "end_seconds": 224.35,
      "duration_seconds": 6.59,
      "text": "Okay: heart rate 71, blood pressure 117 over 68, temperature 36.4, respiratory rate 17."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.38,
      "end_seconds": 229.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "Alright, over here please and I'll take a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.81,
      "end_seconds": 232.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.18,
      "end_seconds": 258.21,
      "duration_seconds": 7.03,
      "text": "There is a shallow ulcer above the inner ankle with brown skin around it and visible varicose veins."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.05,
      "end_seconds": 266.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Alright, good, you can sit up again."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.69,
      "end_seconds": 287.16,
      "duration_seconds": 8.47,
      "text": "Okay, so my impression is this: This looks most like a venous leg ulcer. Another possibility is an arterial ulcer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.79,
      "end_seconds": 322.62,
      "duration_seconds": 24.83,
      "text": "We should do a doppler test of the leg pulses for leg ulcer. Compression bandaging and keeping the leg raised when sitting. Let's hold off on a wound swab for now, and if there's no change in two weeks we can revisit it. I'd like you back in two weeks. How would you describe the plan, so we're on the same page?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 324.45,
      "end_seconds": 329.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "text": "So, I come back in two weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 329.8,
      "end_seconds": 334.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 335.35,
      "end_seconds": 337.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Alright, thanks, take care."
    }
  ]
}